---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy & Cookie Policy | Peaks and Puddles" description="UK GDPR privacy notice explaining how Peaks and Puddles uses analytics, advertising pixels, and affiliate tracking cookies.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-8">
    <article class="app-prose max-w-none">
      <h1>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>

      <p>
        <strong>Peaks and Puddles</strong> (<code>peaksandpuddles.co.uk</code>) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data in accordance with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Direct Contact:</strong> If you email us at <a href="mailto:hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk">hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk</a>, we only use your email address and message details to reply to your enquiry. We never sell or rent email addresses.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage &amp; Analytics Data:</strong> We use privacy-configured analytics tools (including Google Analytics 4 via Google Tag Manager) to understand which gear guides and articles parents find most useful (such as page views, approximate region, and device type).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Cookies, Pixels &amp; Affiliate Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        When you browse this website or click through to an external retailer, small text files ("cookies") may be placed on your browser:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Affiliate Referral Cookies (Amazon Associates, Awin):</strong> When you click a product link to a partner retailer, a referral cookie is set so the retailer knows you visited from Peaks and Puddles. These cookies typically expire within 24 hours to 30 days and do not give us access to your name, address, or payment details.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising &amp; Conversion Measurement (Google Ads &amp; Meta Pixel):</strong> We may use Google Tag Manager and the Meta Pixel to measure the effectiveness of our informational articles and ad campaigns.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can block or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Your UK GDPR Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK data protection law, you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal information you have shared with us. To exercise these rights, contact <a href="mailto:hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk">hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>